From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ogdanimal <the.ogdanimal@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:07:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Android patches for Goemon64Recomp-Android

Build (CMakeLists) and runtime changes to run RT64 on Android: file dialog,
application/window handling, present queue, framebuffer renderer, and
FbCommon shader adjustments.
---
